OL,3,ASanders calls on US to work with China
OL,4,Aon AI regulation as top tech bosses
OL,5,Aspeak in California
OL,6,
OL,7,FBernie Sanders calls on the US to work
OL,8,Fwith China on AI regulation, saying a
OL,9,Ftreaty should be established pause
OL,10,Fdevelopment on "AI superintelligence"
OL,12,FHis remarks were made at a summit in
OL,13,FWashington, where Steve Bannon, a
OL,14,Fformer Trump adviser, has also
OL,15,Faddressed regulating the AI industry -
OL,16,Fa rare show of bipartisanship, writes
OL,17,Four Washington correspondent
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
