OL,3,ASanders calls on US to work with China
OL,4,Aon AI regulation as top tech bosses
OL,5,Aspeak in California
OL,6,
OL,7,FElsewhere, top AI bosses - including
OL,8,FOpenAI's Sam Altman and Anthropic's
OL,9,FDario Amodei - are speaking publicly
OL,10,Ffor the first time since the slowdown
OL,11,Fdebate emerged this week
OL,13,FIt all comes one day after an Anthropic
OL,14,Fexecutive told the BBC that AI is
OL,15,Fgetting more powerful "by the day" and
OL,16,Fa kill switch should be mandatory
OL,18,FEarlier this week, Donald Trump
OL,19,Fdownplayed AI concerns, saying claims
OL,20,Fthat it will take over the world are a
OL,21,F"hoax"
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
